      "content": "breathing doesnt really change the fact that i'm a ghost. like, i walk around and people look right through me. i feel like a glitch in the system or something. it’s just exhausting pretending to be a person when no one even recognizes me as one anymore. it just feels like i'm waiting for something to actually happen, you know? like im just stuck in this waiting room.",
